{
  "info": {
    "name": "Nexus Partner API \u2014 Consortium Sandbox",
    "description": "Call the federated network's partner API yourself. Run request 0 first to mint a sandbox organization and key (you need an invite code from the network admin), copy the returned values into the api_key and eso_org_id variables, then work through the rest in order \u2014 or improvise. Every upsert is idempotent: re-running never creates duplicates. Works in Postman, Insomnia, Bruno, Hoppscotch, or as plain curl.\n\nNote: records you create here persist in the sandbox until its periodic purge \u2014 unlike the web demo, which resets its sample data on reload.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://us-central1-entrepreneurship-nexus-staging.cloudfunctions.net",
      "description": "Sandbox Cloud Functions base URL (no trailing slash)"
    },
    {
      "key": "invite_code",
      "value": "ASK_JR_FOR_THIS",
      "description": "Sandbox provisioning code \u2014 not published; ask the network admin"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SANDBOX_KEY",
      "description": "Your org-scoped X-Nexus-API-Key"
    },
    {
      "key": "eso_org_id",
      "value": "org_ef",
      "description": "Your organization's Nexus org id"
    },
    {
      "key": "ecosystem_id",
      "value": "eco_connecticut",
      "description": "The demo ecosystem"
    },
    {
      "key": "source",
      "value": "my_crm",
      "description": "A stable name for YOUR system \u2014 your external_ref namespace"
    },
    {
      "key": "demo_email",
      "value": "ada.demo@example.com",
      "description": "Change to test the link-by-email flow across two orgs"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 \u00b7 Provision your sandbox org + key (needs invite code)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/provisionDemoAgency",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Your Organization Name\",\n  \"invite_code\": \"{{invite_code}}\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Run this FIRST. Returns your demo organization id and a one-time API key \u2014 copy them into the collection variables eso_org_id and api_key. The key is shown once and is never retrievable again.\n\nThe invite code is not published (this repository is public); ask JR for it. A wrong or missing code returns 401."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "1 \u00b7 Register an entrepreneur (create)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Nexus-API-Key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/partnerUpsertPerson",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"external_ref\": { \"source\": \"{{source}}\", \"id\": \"contact-1\" },\n  \"ecosystem_id\": \"{{ecosystem_id}}\",\n  \"eso_org_id\": \"{{eso_org_id}}\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Ada\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Founder\",\n  \"email\": \"{{demo_email}}\",\n  \"tags\": [\"entrepreneur\"],\n  \"send_consent_email\": false\n}"
        },
        "description": "First run returns action: \"created\" and a nexus_id. Run it again: action becomes \"updated\", same nexus_id \u2014 idempotent. Set send_consent_email true to send the real opt-in email (use a test inbox)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2 \u00b7 Same email from a second org (link)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Nexus-API-Key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/partnerUpsertPerson",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"external_ref\": { \"source\": \"{{source}}_second_system\", \"id\": \"m-77\" },\n  \"ecosystem_id\": \"{{ecosystem_id}}\",\n  \"eso_org_id\": \"{{eso_org_id}}\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Ada\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Founder\",\n  \"email\": \"{{demo_email}}\",\n  \"tags\": [\"patent\"]\n}"
        },
        "description": "To see the true cross-org moment, run this with ANOTHER org's key and org id (or ask the person next to you to run request 1 with the same email from their org): response is action: \"linked\", same nexus_id \u2014 one shared identity, no central signup, no duplicate."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3 \u00b7 Read the person back (privacy scoping)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Nexus-API-Key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/partnerGetPerson?source={{source}}&id=contact-1",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "partnerGetPerson"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "source",
              "value": "{{source}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": "contact-1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Note external_refs in the response: only YOUR org's refs are returned, even when other orgs are linked to the same person. Tags are merged across orgs."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4 \u00b7 Record a participation",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Nexus-API-Key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/partnerUpsertParticipation",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"person_external_ref\": { \"source\": \"{{source}}\", \"id\": \"contact-1\" },\n  \"participation_external_ref\": { \"source\": \"{{source}}\", \"id\": \"contact-1_program\" },\n  \"ecosystem_id\": \"{{ecosystem_id}}\",\n  \"eso_org_id\": \"{{eso_org_id}}\",\n  \"participation_type\": \"program\",\n  \"name\": \"Business Plan Competition 2026\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"start_date\": \"2026-08-01\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Typed, dated involvement. Valid types: membership, program, application, residency, rental, event, service. Statuses: active, past, applied, waitlisted. Requires the person to exist (run request 1 first)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5 \u00b7 Push a venture (organization)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Nexus-API-Key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/partnerUpsertOrganization",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"external_ref\": { \"source\": \"{{source}}\", \"id\": \"org-99\" },\n  \"ecosystem_id\": \"{{ecosystem_id}}\",\n  \"eso_org_id\": \"{{eso_org_id}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Rivera Robotics LLC\",\n  \"description\": \"Subsea inspection drones.\",\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"tax_status\": \"for_profit\",\n  \"tags\": [\"manufacturing\"]\n}"
        },
        "description": "Use when your system tracks the venture separately from the person. Same idempotency and resolution rules as people: external_ref first, then exact name within the ecosystem, then create. Re-run it and action becomes \"updated\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6 \u00b7 Subscribe to referral webhooks",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Nexus-API-Key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/partnerRegisterWebhook",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"url\": \"https://webhook.site/REPLACE-ME\",\n  \"events\": [\"referral.received\", \"referral.updated\", \"person.linked\"],\n  \"description\": \"Sandbox experiment\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Grab a free URL from webhook.site and paste it in to watch HMAC-signed deliveries arrive live. Store the signing_secret from the response \u2014 it is shown once."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7a \u00b7 Guard: no key \u2192 401",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/partnerUpsertPerson",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"external_ref\": { \"source\": \"x\", \"id\": \"1\" },\n  \"ecosystem_id\": \"{{ecosystem_id}}\",\n  \"eso_org_id\": \"{{eso_org_id}}\",\n  \"first_name\": \"A\", \"last_name\": \"B\", \"email\": \"a@b.com\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Machine-to-machine only: no key, no entry."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7b \u00b7 Guard: impersonating another org \u2192 403",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Nexus-API-Key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/partnerUpsertPerson",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"external_ref\": { \"source\": \"{{source}}\", \"id\": \"contact-1\" },\n  \"ecosystem_id\": \"{{ecosystem_id}}\",\n  \"eso_org_id\": \"org_somebody_else\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Ada\", \"last_name\": \"Founder\", \"email\": \"{{demo_email}}\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Your key can only write as your org. Every write in the network is attributable."
      }
    }
  ]
}
